{"query_id": "q01", "query": "when am I charged each month?", "doc_uri": "help://billing/invoices", "chunk_id": "c1:7df38ec6d5c5280cd3ff56778da125ef", "text_sha": "t1:ef9407571be95f23186b2b4319540abc", "chunk_text": "Invoices are issued on the first business day of each month and charged to the payment method on file.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "billing"}
{"query_id": "q02", "query": "what happens if my card is declined?", "doc_uri": "help://billing/invoices", "chunk_id": "c1:e2c4c6f69f38e4ae45d437be12e5c439", "text_sha": "t1:5b2d8b8db116f672bedb202640a465bf", "chunk_text": "A failed payment is retried three times over six days before the subscription is suspended.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "billing"}
{"query_id": "q03", "query": "can I get a refund on an annual plan?", "doc_uri": "help://billing/refunds", "chunk_id": "c1:f5772a2b45b81d5d0cadf419c3a0f92d", "text_sha": "t1:17ca5a0c159688082bbc8c5e50457d23", "chunk_text": "Annual plans may be refunded within 30 days of renewal, prorated to the day of the request.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "billing"}
{"query_id": "q03", "query": "can I get a refund on an annual plan?", "doc_uri": "help://billing/refunds", "chunk_id": "c1:7f5f7b88b53fea8116dd359759367eac", "text_sha": "t1:2509bb7ea5654ec9d83fdffd442a2e89", "chunk_text": "Monthly plans are not refundable after the billing date, but you can cancel to stop the next charge.", "relevance": 1, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "billing"}
{"query_id": "q04", "query": "how long does delivery take?", "doc_uri": "help://shipping/delivery", "chunk_id": "c1:54130ce877f726b3011378d1a29305f0", "text_sha": "t1:da43e17b88ca97caa3a5287fefb247b4", "chunk_text": "Standard delivery takes three to five business days once the order leaves the warehouse.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "shipping"}
{"query_id": "q04", "query": "how long does delivery take?", "doc_uri": "help://shipping/delivery", "chunk_id": "c1:48d45cb90ccb0e5a65d4382f303e001e", "text_sha": "t1:509deb2cb08701f7bdeccd472934124f", "chunk_text": "Express delivery arrives the next business day for orders placed before 2pm local time.", "relevance": 1, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "shipping"}
{"query_id": "q05", "query": "how do I return something I did not open?", "doc_uri": "help://shipping/returns", "chunk_id": "c1:84a59f357a53889d1c0a6815c09dbe84", "text_sha": "t1:cab80f36be803b0037f527d068489626", "chunk_text": "Unopened items can be returned within 45 days using the prepaid label in the box.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "shipping"}
{"query_id": "q06", "query": "who pays for return shipping?", "doc_uri": "help://shipping/returns", "chunk_id": "c1:e1f62b47b1124bae32ce9bcfe652137d", "text_sha": "t1:548e6e627f4bc8d11b95739f1813fb79", "chunk_text": "Return shipping is free for exchanges and deducted from the refund otherwise.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "shipping"}
{"query_id": "q07", "query": "how are disputes handled?", "doc_uri": "help://legal/terms", "chunk_id": "c1:8d69dbfa9ba9babb6a0dd33e2a096095", "text_sha": "t1:70f41dab2916e01a8a56c90778a89da4", "chunk_text": "Disputes are resolved by binding arbitration in the customer's country of residence.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "legal"}
{"query_id": "q08", "query": "how long do you keep my data after I leave?", "doc_uri": "help://legal/privacy", "chunk_id": "c1:04223e70378b329a848102a444b4181a", "text_sha": "t1:6b56840ee60ad7660d98335537054f86", "chunk_text": "Personal data is retained for 24 months after the last account activity, then deleted.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "legal"}
{"query_id": "q09", "query": "can I ask for a copy of my data?", "doc_uri": "help://legal/privacy", "chunk_id": "c1:8a1da9c4acf280bd67ac57b7107d911e", "text_sha": "t1:96dacb2065853c11c6067bb60682af84", "chunk_text": "A data export can be requested at any time and is delivered within 30 days.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "legal"}
{"query_id": "q10", "query": "I forgot my password", "doc_uri": "help://account/access", "chunk_id": "c1:f44f96f1250f7fbcad9c60d42a8f02e3", "text_sha": "t1:ca2ff2fa0111086daae509ea61e3a2dc", "chunk_text": "Passwords can be reset from the sign-in page using the email address on the account.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "account"}
{"query_id": "q11", "query": "is two-factor authentication required?", "doc_uri": "help://account/access", "chunk_id": "c1:85a7d970937a0c0258d6186f3820402c", "text_sha": "t1:353bda356fa8738f958c126e96ca6928", "chunk_text": "Two-factor authentication can be enabled per user and is required for admin roles.", "relevance": 2, "corpus_fingerprint": "recursive/512/64", "labeled_by": "human:support-lead", "labeled_at": "2026-09-02T09:14:00Z", "stratum": "account"}
